{"version":1,"pages":[{"id":"p2","title":"2. Beta signup (/beta) · cycle 2","shapes":[{"id":"doc-title-p2","type":"text","boundingBox":{"x":0,"y":-860,"w":4400,"h":200},"text":"<p style='font-size:40pt;text-align:left'><b>Harvest concept site · Cycle 2 review (PR #1)</b><br><span style='font-size:20pt'>Home hero CTA &gt; /beta &gt; filled form &gt; success · Desktop 1440×1024 · commit 7a89b64 · https://deploy-preview-1--harvest-for-lucid.netlify.app</span></p>"},{"id":"legend-box-p2","type":"text","boundingBox":{"x":0,"y":-560,"w":2600,"h":360},"text":"<p style='font-size:22pt;text-align:left'><b>How to review</b><br>Leave feedback as sticky notes INSIDE the screen's frame. Start a note with <b>Do:</b>, <b>Must do</b>, <b>Try:</b> or <b>Consider:</b> to set its priority (the words win over the colour); otherwise the colour counts: <span style='color:#C62828'><b>Red = Do / Must do</b></span>, <span style='color:#9A7B00'><b>Yellow = Try</b></span>, <span style='color:#1565C0'><b>Blue = Consider</b></span>. <span style='color:#BA23F6'><b>Purple = Board format</b></span> (notes about this board's layout). Comments are read as general feedback.</p>"},{"id":"legend-must-p2","type":"rectangle","boundingBox":{"x":2700,"y":-530,"w":260,"h":300},"style":{"fill":{"type":"color","color":"#FF8A80"},"stroke":{"color":"#C62828","width":2,"style":"solid"}},"text":"<p style='font-size:24pt;text-align:center'><b>Red</b><br>Do / Must do</p>"},{"id":"legend-try-p2","type":"rectangle","boundingBox":{"x":3020,"y":-530,"w":260,"h":300},"style":{"fill":{"type":"color","color":"#FFE066"},"stroke":{"color":"#9A7B00","width":2,"style":"solid"}},"text":"<p style='font-size:24pt;text-align:center'><b>Yellow</b><br>Try</p>"},{"id":"legend-maybe-p2","type":"rectangle","boundingBox":{"x":3340,"y":-530,"w":260,"h":300},"style":{"fill":{"type":"color","color":"#A3E4FF"},"stroke":{"color":"#1565C0","width":2,"style":"solid"}},"text":"<p style='font-size:24pt;text-align:center'><b>Blue</b><br>Consider</p>"},{"id":"legend-board-p2","type":"rectangle","boundingBox":{"x":3660,"y":-530,"w":260,"h":300},"style":{"fill":{"type":"color","color":"#BA23F6"},"stroke":{"color":"#7B1FA2","width":2,"style":"solid"},"textColor":"#FFFFFF"},"text":"<p style='font-size:24pt;text-align:center'><b>Purple</b><br>Board format</p>"},{"id":"frame-beta-01-home-cta","type":"sparkFrame","boundingBox":{"x":0,"y":0,"w":2240,"h":3684},"style":{"fill":{"type":"color","color":"#F2F3F5"},"stroke":{"color":"#F2F3F5","width":0,"style":"solid"}},"customData":[{"key":"stepKey","value":"beta-01-home-cta"},{"key":"route","value":"/"},{"key":"cycle","value":"2"},{"key":"flow","value":"beta-signup"}],"title":"beta-01-home-cta · / · Harvest | Lucid"},{"id":"img-beta-01-home-cta","type":"image","boundingBox":{"x":400,"y":400,"w":1440,"h":1024},"image":{"type":"image","url":"https://journey-assets-ai-xform.netlify.app/harvest-site-c2-beta-signup/01-beta-01-home-cta.png"},"stroke":{"color":"#C9CED8","width":2,"style":"solid"}},{"id":"hdr-beta-01-home-cta","type":"text","boundingBox":{"x":400,"y":1784,"w":1440,"h":200},"text":"<p style='font-size:22pt;text-align:left'><b>1. beta-01-home-cta</b>  ·  /<br><span style='font-size:16pt'>Harvest | Lucid  —  h1: “Turn every sticky note into a pull request”  —  click: link “Get early access”</span></p>"},{"id":"changes-beta-signup-1","type":"text","boundingBox":{"x":400,"y":2044,"w":1280,"h":518},"text":"<p style='font-size:20pt;text-align:left'><b>Changes in this cycle</b> (vs cycle 1)<br><br>• [must] “Get on the list” announcement banner removed (#1)<br>• [must] Caption under the hero buttons removed (#2)<br>• [try] Hero eyebrow removed (#4)<br>• [try] Single header: Lucid menu bar removed, sticky Harvest nav with “Join the beta”; product renamed “Harvest” (#3)</p>"},{"id":"before-lbl-beta-signup-1","type":"text","boundingBox":{"x":400,"y":2622,"w":840,"h":90},"text":"<p style='font-size:20pt;text-align:left'><b>Cycle 1 (before) · reference only</b></p>"},{"id":